          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How do I remove the trapped hair from the mitt?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>As you groom your pet, loose fur clings to the 255 silicone nodes. Once full, simply peel off the collected fur layer in one clean sheet and discard.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_kdV9Lf": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I use the grooming mitt during bath time?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! The water-resistant mesh backing and silicone nodes make it excellent for lathering shampoo, deshedding, and giving your pet a relaxing bath massage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_LBnmdE": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How do I clean and maintain the mitt?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Simply rinse under warm water with mild soap after each grooming session, or wash on a gentle machine cycle and allow to air dry.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
